&lt;p&gt;Our vision is to build the next generation platform to enable easy and fast creation of audio and video content powered by cutting-edge AI. Building a revolutionary way to record, transcribe, edit, and mix spoken audio and video comes with a series of unique challenges and requires solving hard and complex problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a lead product data scientist on the team, you will play a critical role in shaping our growth strategy, up-leveling our experimentation culture, and scaling our business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct in-depth analysis to shape product PLG motion and B2B strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop deep understanding of the product ecosystem and identify opportunities to drive activation, engagement, and monetization through actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leveraging AI tools to build and maintain self-service analytics enabling stakeholders to access reliable metrics, size opportunities, design experiments, and interpret results independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve execution rigor of product teams by owning success metrics and opportunity sizing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brain buddy with product and engineering teams for day-to-day experiment design, deployment, and analysis. Provide creative solutions for tricky experimentation scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve experimentation culture and practices within the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–8 years of experience in a Data Scientist or similar role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years working in a growth function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business and product intuition to identify opportunities in the growth ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of statistical analysis and A/B tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL skills and proficient in at least one programming language such as Python or R.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
